WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.077
The Mughals recorded their reigns

2
00:00:02.077 --> 00:00:03.743
in illustrated histories.

3
00:00:03.743 --> 00:00:04.975
And built some of the

4
00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:07.092
world's most famous monuments.

5
00:00:07.435 --> 00:00:09.686
Abul Fazl wrote the Akbarnama.

6
00:00:09.686 --> 00:00:11.601
Babur wrote his own memoir,

7
00:00:11.601 --> 00:00:12.649
the Baburnama,

8
00:00:12.649 --> 00:00:13.816
in Turki.

9
00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.377
Work on the Taj Mahal

10
00:00:16.377 --> 00:00:18.720
began around 1632,

11
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.024
and was completed around 1653.

12
00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:26.020
Court workshops produced miniature paintings,

13
00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.104
at their finest under Akbar

14
00:00:28.104 --> 00:00:29.609
and Jahangir.

15
00:00:29.961 --> 00:00:31.132
Your turn.

16
00:00:31.132 --> 00:00:32.653
Who wrote it?
